# PickUp Patrol parent account — the same email + password you use at
# https://app.pickuppatrol.net/. Copy this file to `.env` and fill it in.
#
# The server logs in server-side and holds the resulting bearer token in
# memory only. It never retries a rejected password: PickUp Patrol answers a
# bad login with LOGIN-ERROR-* and repeated failures have to be cleared through
# their support desk, so one wrong value must not turn into a lockout.
PICKUPPATROL_USERNAME=
PICKUPPATROL_PASSWORD=

# Optional: a one-time 2FA code, if your account has two-factor enabled.
# PICKUPPATROL_OTP=
